="num services_dates__K1uzi">2019 → 2020</span><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 13V3M3.5 7.5 8 3l4.5 4.5"></path></svg></span></a></li></ul></div></li><li class="services_offer__stKCb" data-reveal=""><h3 class="t-title">Fractional engineering lead</h3><p class="t-body services_body__ueN4k">I lead the team while you hire: rituals, code review standards, the roadmap, and the hiring loop. Whoever you hire walks into a team that already runs.</p><div class="services_proof__U7XMe"><p class="t-meta services_proofLabel__u1cVh">Where I did it</p><ul class="services_receipts__B4wQ5"><li class="services_receipt__4kZ4M" data-reveal="" style="--i:1"><strong class="num services_figure__OUOCz">6</strong> <span class="t-small services_text__QayGR">teams at once under my lead</span><a class="t-meta services_cite__SE9mk" href="#work">Work <span class="services_glue__fbCof">history<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 13V3M3.5 7.5 8 3l4.5 4.5"></path></svg></span></a></li><li class="services_receipt__4kZ4M" data-reveal="" style="--i:2"><strong class="num services_figure__OUOCz">56</strong> <span class="t-small services_text__QayGR">people reported up to me at my largest</span><a class="t-meta services_cite__SE9mk" href="#work">Work <span class="services_glue__fbCof">history<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 13V3M3.5 7.5 8 3l4.5 4.5"></path></svg></span></a></li><li class="services_receipt__4kZ4M" data-reveal="" style="--i:3"><strong class="num services_figure__OUOCz">4.6</strong> <span class="t-small services_text__QayGR">App Store stars on D-ID&#x27;s app, which I built from