ntColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 13V3M3.5 7.5 8 3l4.5 4.5"></path></svg></span></a></li></ul></div></li></ul><div class="services_flow__ZOkoB"><h3 class="t-title services_flowTitle__3QLg9" data-reveal="">How an engagement runs.</h3><ol class="services_steps__DXqtb" data-draw=""><li><strong class="t-title">Review</strong><p class="t-body">I read the code, the release pipeline, and the backlog, and talk to whoever owns each one.</p><p class="services_out__JpcZ8"><span class="t-meta">You get</span><span class="t-small">A list of what&#x27;s slowing you down, ranked by risk</span></p></li><li style="--i:1"><strong class="t-title">Plan</strong><p class="t-body">A short written plan: what to fix first, what it costs, and what can wait.</p><p class="services_out__JpcZ8"><span class="t-meta">You get</span><span class="t-small">A written plan, in order and costed</span></p></li><li style="--i:2"><strong class="t-title">Ship</strong><p class="t-body">I work inside your team on the riskiest part first: the migration, the slow screens, the release train.</p><p class="services_out__JpcZ8"><span class="t-meta">You get</span><span class="t-small">Pull requests in your repo, reviewed by your team</span></p></li><li style="--i:3"><strong class="t-title">Hand off</strong><p class="t-body">Docs, review standards, and an owner on your team for each piece.</p><p class="services_out__JpcZ8"><span class="t-meta">You get</span><span class="t-small">A team that keeps it running without me</span></p></li></ol></div></section><figure class="interlude wrap" data-reveal=""><blockquote class="interlude-text" data-scrub="ink"><p><span class="visually-hidden">I&#x27;d highly recommend Gabriel to any organization looking for a strong engineering leader who genuinely cares about both his people and the success of the business.</span><span aria-hidden="true"><span class="ink-w" style="--w:0">I&#x27;d</span> <span class="ink-w" style="--w:0.0384615